        <h2 class="text-success">Introduction to HTML</h2>

        <p>
            HTML stands for HyperText Markup Language.
            It is the standard language used to create web pages.
            HTML provides the basic structure of a website.
            It uses different tags such as heading, paragraph,
            image, table, list and link.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-danger">Introduction to CSS</h2>

        <p>
            CSS stands for Cascading Style Sheets.
            It is used to design and decorate web pages.
            CSS helps us to change background colors, text colors,
            font size, margin, padding and borders.
            It makes websites beautiful and attractive.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-primary">Introduction to Bootstrap</h2>

        <p>
            Bootstrap is a popular front-end framework.
            It is used to create responsive websites easily.
            Bootstrap provides ready-made classes for buttons,
            containers, grids, tables, forms and navigation bars.
            It saves time and makes web development easier.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-success">Advantages of Bootstrap</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Easy to learn and use.</li>
            <li>Creates responsive websites.</li>
            <li>Saves development time.</li>
            <li>Provides ready-made CSS classes.</li>
            <li>Supports mobile devices.</li>
        </ul>

